# THE HEAVY BLOW (mechanics pass, slice 1c; FightRules.HEAVY_*). The swing key
# held past HEAVY_HOLD_MS throws the heavy blow: the tool held drawn back for its
# long windup, strokes thrown up off the body, then the strike, for twice the
# damage. Staged on a harvester at its work, which is open to it, from above and
# then over the shoulder locked on. The frame mid-hold is the claim: a player
# must SEE that the blow is coming slow, and so can a machine's reader.
# Run at a fixed rate, so the frame mid-hold costs the world no time and the
# blow that lands after it is the one awaited:
#   TOUR_FIXED_FPS=60 tools/tour.sh tours/heavy_blow.tour --seed=4 --hour=11 --weather=clear:0 --give=knife:1 --held=knife
coast calm
zoom 7
wait 0.6
spawn harvester
wait 0.6
shot 01-a-harvester-at-its-work with mob:harvester
# A worker walks its round, so the blow may meet its flank and ring: a player
# who misses goes round to the front and holds it again.
try 6
walkto part 3
hold swing
wait 0.45
shot 02-held-the-tool-drawn-back with mob:harvester
release swing
await hit 1.5
end
shot 03-the-heavy-blow-lands with mob:harvester
wait 0.6
shot 04-after with mob:harvester

coast calm
tap shoulder
await shoulder 3
spawn harvester
wait 0.6
hold target
await target 5
await shoulder_locked 3
shot 05-over-the-shoulder-locked-on-it with shoulder_locked,mob:harvester
try 6
walkto part 3
await lock_facing 1
hold swing
wait 0.45
shot 06-over-the-shoulder-held-drawn-back with shoulder_locked,mob:harvester
release swing
await hit 1.5
end
shot 07-over-the-shoulder-the-heavy-blow-lands with shoulder_locked,mob:harvester
release target
